{"id":"68f7dcaae0b215fe","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-shelah-uniqueness.md","title":"Pseudopower Bounds Eligible True Cofinalities","display":"thm-shelah-uniqueness — Pseudopower Bounds Eligible True Cofinalities","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-shelah-uniqueness","aliases":["58-thm-shelah-uniqueness"],"display":"thm-shelah-uniqueness — Pseudopower Bounds Eligible True Cofinalities","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-pcf-theory.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-shelah-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-shelah-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shelah-uniqueness — Pseudopower Bounds Eligible True Cofinalities"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0fe5eb4041a169e\" href=\"?note=c0fe5eb4041a169e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-pcf-theory.md\">../batch05/58-df-pcf-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\theta\">\\(\\mu,\\theta\\)</span> (cardinal parameters; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> is singular)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sing}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sing}\\)</span> (singular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reg}\">\\(\\operatorname{Reg}\\)</span> (class of regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf},\\operatorname{tcf},\\operatorname{pp}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf},\\operatorname{tcf},\\operatorname{pp}\\)</span> (cofinality, true cofinality, and pseudopower operators)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mu\\cap\\operatorname{Reg}\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mu\\cap\\operatorname{Reg}\\)</span> (a cofinal set of regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (a proper ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_A^{\\mathrm{bd}}=\\{B\\subseteq A:\\sup B&lt;\\sup A\\}\">\\(J_A^{\\mathrm{bd}}=\\{B\\subseteq A:\\sup B&lt;\\sup A\\}\\)</span> (bounded ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperIdeal}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperIdeal}\\)</span> (proper-ideal predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Sing}(\\mu)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mu\\cap\\operatorname{Reg}\n\\land\\sup A=\\mu\n\\land|A|=\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)&lt;\\min A\n\\land\\operatorname{ProperIdeal}(J,A)\n\\land J_A^{\\mathrm{bd}}\\subseteq J\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\theta=\\operatorname{tcf}\\left(\\prod A/J\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\to\\theta\\leq\\operatorname{pp}(\\mu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Sing}(\\mu)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mu\\cap\\operatorname{Reg}\n\\land\\sup A=\\mu\n\\land|A|=\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)&lt;\\min A\n\\land\\operatorname{ProperIdeal}(J,A)\n\\land J_A^{\\mathrm{bd}}\\subseteq J\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\theta=\\operatorname{tcf}\\left(\\prod A/J\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\to\\theta\\leq\\operatorname{pp}(\\mu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pp}(\\mu)\">\\(\\operatorname{pp}(\\mu)\\)</span> is the supremum of the true cofinalities of all products satisfying the displayed eligibility conditions, so every witness is bounded by it.</li>\n<li>A cofinal subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> cannot have size below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)\\)</span>; the standard presentation uses a sequence or set of length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The former assertion also incorrectly claimed that the supremum must be attained by one product modulo the bounded ideal. The legacy label is retained for link stability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-pcf-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"c0fe5eb4041a169e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-pcf-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sing}$ (singular-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu,\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Reg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf},\\operatorname{tcf},\\operatorname{pp}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mu\\cap\\operatorname{Reg}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"J_A^{\\mathrm{bd}}=\\{B\\subseteq A:\\sup B<\\sup A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperIdeal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}uniqueness}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Sing}(\\mu)\n\\land A\\subseteq\\mu\\cap\\operatorname{Reg}\n\\land\\sup A=\\mu\n\\land|A|=\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\mu)<\\min A\n\\land\\operatorname{ProperIdeal}(J,A)\n\\land J_A^{\\mathrm{bd}}\\subseteq J\\\\\n&{}\\land\\theta=\\operatorname{tcf}\\left(\\prod A/J\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\to\\theta\\leq\\operatorname{pp}(\\mu).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pp}(\\mu)","display":false}